 "description": "The pair ids Bitfinex itself publishes for its spot exchange, optionally filtered by a substring \u2014 the lookup that stops a bot guessing a market that does not exist. Costs $0.001 USDC per call. Byte-identical to GET /market/bfex-pairs?contains=USD&limit=20.",
